{{#if has_region_axis}}
### Region-migration axis

Region migrations move tenants across data-center / cloud-region boundaries. The hard parts are residency consent (BEFORE any boundary crossing), dual-write contracts during the cutover window, DNS / routing cutover, and cross-DC blue-green deployment of the tenant's runtime.

**CRITICAL** (per `region-migration-playbook.md`): Region migration MUST obtain consent BEFORE any data movement crossing residency boundaries (GDPR Art 6 + Schrems II). Consent-then-move-then-finalize is the only legitimate pattern.

